Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 14:11:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD reviewed-feature confirmation after clean review

Clean automatic reviews return focus to the patch-agent chat and ask the user whether the feature is done. A confirmed feature closes that chat until later input reopens it, which keeps reviewed work out of the ready state while still preserving the original patch-agent conversation for follow-up work.
